(text "MCU. STM32H743VIT6 LQFP-100. HSE 25MHz, LSE 32.768kHz. SWD header + JP1 (CM5 SWD, optional). CM5 reflash: USART1 PA9/PA10 bootloader, BOOT0 via 1k, NRST via NPN open-collector; PC2_C = CM5 heartbeat.\nPeripherals: SPI4 slave to CM5, USART2 to CM5, FDCAN1/2, USART3 RS-485, I2C1 (expanders/ADC/FRAM), SPI1 to ADE9000s via isolators." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c083f5a6-5aed-4299-bfca-406d06381241"))
)
